# ABOUT US PAGE – ULTRA PREMIUM CINEMATIC DESIGN & ANIMATION PROMPT
## WoW Studio | Luxury Wedding Photography & Cinematic Films

Redesign and upgrade the complete existing About Us page into an extraordinary, premium cinematic storytelling experience inspired by international luxury wedding photography and film production websites.

The page should communicate the brand's story, vision, creativity, passion, experience, and cinematic excellence through beautiful visuals and sophisticated animations.

### 1. ABOUT HERO SECTION
- Create an immersive full-screen cinematic hero.
- Use premium wedding film background footage or existing photography.
- Add slow cinematic camera zoom and subtle parallax.
- Animate the "ABOUT WoW STUDIO" heading with split-text reveal.
- Reveal the subtitle with elegant blur-to-sharp animation.
- Add a minimal scroll indicator.
- Use sophisticated dark gradient overlays for readability.

### 2. OUR STORY
- Create an emotional editorial storytelling layout.
- Display the brand story alongside a large cinematic photograph.
- Reveal paragraphs line by line as the user scrolls.
- Animate images using smooth clipping-mask transitions.
- Add subtle 3D perspective and camera movement.
- Highlight important words using elegant typography.

### 3. OUR CREATIVE PHILOSOPHY
- Create an immersive typography-focused section.
- Reveal the main statement word by word.
- Add animated background imagery and subtle parallax.
- Highlight the brand's creative philosophy with sophisticated typography.
- Use cinematic transitions between text and visual elements.

### 4. OUR APPROACH / WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT
- Create premium feature cards with original layouts.
- Use cinematic right-to-left card movement.
- Add 3D depth, staggered reveals, and smooth hover effects.
- Each card should communicate one brand strength.
- Avoid ordinary static Bootstrap-style cards.

### 5. OUR EXPERTISE
Showcase the studio's services using premium visual storytelling:
- Wedding Photography
- Cinematic Wedding Films
- Pre-Wedding Films
- Destination Weddings
- Candid Photography
- Luxury Event Coverage

Use elegant image reveals, subtle zoom, horizontal movement, and interactive hover transitions.

### 6. OUR JOURNEY / MILESTONES
- Create a sophisticated animated timeline.
- Reveal milestones progressively during scrolling.
- Use a moving timeline line.
- Animate numbers only when genuine data is available.
- Add elegant image transitions between milestones.

### 7. BEHIND THE LENS / OUR TEAM
- Create an editorial photography-style team showcase.
- Use premium portrait layouts.
- Apply subtle 3D image hover effects.
- Reveal names and designations elegantly.
- Use cinematic image transitions.

### 8. OUR MASTER COLLECTION
- Add a premium portfolio preview.
- Use asymmetrical editorial image composition.
- Add cinematic horizontal gallery movement.
- Use smooth image reveal masks and 3D parallax.
- Connect to the existing portfolio page.

### 9. CLIENT LOVE
- Add a premium testimonial showcase.
- Use floating 3D testimonial cards.
- Add smooth horizontal carousel movement.
- Reveal genuine customer reviews and ratings.
- Include elegant star animations.

### 10. FINAL CINEMATIC CTA
- Create a full-width cinematic closing section.
- Use premium wedding film background visuals.
- Display "LET'S CREATE CINEMA TOGETHER".
- Add dramatic typography animation.
- Create an elegant animated contact button.
- Transition smoothly into the footer.

## ADVANCED ANIMATION TECHNOLOGY

Use:
- GSAP
- ScrollTrigger
- SplitType or equivalent text-splitting solution
- Lenis only if compatible with the existing scrolling architecture
- CSS 3D transforms
- Image clipping and masking
- Parallax movement
- Scroll-linked storytelling

## PROFESSIONAL ANIMATION RULES
- Every section should have its own unique animation style.
- Do not repeat the same card animation throughout the page.
- Avoid excessive animation and unnecessary movement.
- Maintain smooth transitions between sections.
- Scrolling upward must reverse scroll-linked animations naturally.
- Include subtle entrance animations even without scrolling.
- Maintain readability and visual hierarchy.

## RESPONSIVE & PERFORMANCE
- Fully responsive desktop, tablet, and mobile layouts.
- Optimize all images and videos.
- Lazy-load assets.
- Use GPU-friendly transforms.
- Avoid layout shifts and flickering.
- Target smooth 60 FPS where hardware permits.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Maintain accessibility and SEO-friendly content.

## IMPORTANT DEVELOPMENT INSTRUCTIONS
1. First analyze the existing About page and project structure.
2. Inspect existing images, videos, logos, fonts, and brand colors.
3. Reuse existing assets wherever appropriate.
4. Preserve genuine company information and existing content.
5. Do not invent achievements, experience, client counts, awards, or statistics.
6. Maintain existing navbar, footer, routes, and functionality.
7. Implement animations directly into the existing About page.
8. Test all animations on desktop and mobile.

## FINAL EXPECTATION

The final About Us page should look like an award-winning international luxury wedding photography and cinematic film production website.

It must feel emotional, artistic, immersive, sophisticated, and visually unforgettable.

Every section should tell a story through cinematic imagery, elegant typography, premium transitions, and original motion design.

Do not create a separate demo. Implement the complete production-ready About page in the existing project.